                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 45.0, 820.0, 33.0 ],
                    "text": "Receives the sensor's data directly (OSC /mugicdata on UDP port 4000) and re-broadcasts every value with [send]. Keep this patch open, and in your own patch use [r mugic_EX], [r mugic_accel], etc. Quit mugic_capture.py and the MUGIC plugin first: only one program can listen on port 4000."
                }
            },
